    Bug 1802793 - Display custom compose headers in msgHdrView only in outgoing folders. r=john.bieling


    Custom headers contained in `mail.compose.other.header` but not in `mailnews.headers.extraExpandedHeaders` will only be shown in SentMail, Drafts, Queue, and Templates folders.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D224213

